(NORTHWIND BANK LIMITED) Tj T*
(INTERNAL KYC AND CUSTOMER DATA POLICY \(FICTIONAL SAMPLE, VERSION 3.2\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Purpose and scope. This policy sets the minimum Know Your Customer \(KYC\), anti-money) Tj T*
(laundering and customer data requirements for Northwind Bank and for every vendor that) Tj T*
(processes customer data on its behalf. Vendor contracts must not permit practices weaker than) Tj T*
(this policy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Definitions. An officially valid document \(OVD\) is a passport, driving licence, voter) Tj T*
(identity card, job card issued by NREGA, or proof of possession of an Aadhaar number. A) Tj T*
(beneficial owner of a company is any natural person who owns more than 10 percent of its shares) Tj T*
(or capital. A politically exposed person \(PEP\) is an individual entrusted with a prominent) Tj T*
(public function, such as a head of state, senior politician or senior judicial official.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Roles. The Principal Officer, a member of senior management, is responsible for monitoring) Tj T*
(transactions and reporting to the Financial Intelligence Unit \(FIU-IND\). The Designated) Tj T*
(Director, appointed by the Board, is responsible for overall compliance with this policy.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
