(4. Customer acceptance. No account may be opened in an anonymous or fictitious name. No account) Tj T*
(may be opened where customer due diligence cannot be completed because the customer does not) Tj T*
(cooperate or does not provide the required documents.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Customer identification and proof of address. Address must be verified using an officially) Tj T*
(valid document. A customer's self-declaration of address is not acceptable as proof of address) Tj T*
(under any circumstances. A utility bill not older than two months may be accepted as a deemed) Tj T*
(OVD for a limited period, and the customer must then submit an OVD with the current address) Tj T*
(within three months.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Video-based customer identification \(V-CIP\). Customers may be identified through a live) Tj T*
(video call conducted by a trained Bank official. The customer's live location must be geo-) Tj T*
(tagged and must be within India. The video recording and the audit trail must be stored) Tj T*
(securely and retained like other KYC records.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
