(7. Handling of Aadhaar numbers. Neither the Bank nor any vendor may store a customer's full) Tj T*
(Aadhaar number. The first eight digits must be redacted or masked before any copy of an Aadhaar) Tj T*
(document is stored. Offline Aadhaar XML files used for verification must not be more than three) Tj T*
(days old.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. Risk categorisation. Every customer is classified as low, medium or high risk. Politically) Tj T*
(exposed persons, non-resident customers and customers with complex ownership structures are) Tj T*
(classified as high risk. Risk categories are reviewed at least once every six months.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. Enhanced due diligence. Accounts of politically exposed persons require approval from senior) Tj T*
(management before they are opened. For all high-risk customers the Bank must establish the) Tj T*
(source of funds and source of wealth, and monitor transactions more closely.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
