(12. Regulatory reporting. Cash transaction reports for cash transactions above Rs. 10 lakh must) Tj T*
(be filed with FIU-IND every month, by the 15th day of the following month. A suspicious) Tj T*
(transaction report must be filed within seven working days of concluding that a transaction is) Tj T*
(suspicious.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(13. Consent and data sharing. Customer data may be shared with a third party only with the) Tj T*
(customer's explicit, informed consent and only for the purpose stated at the time of consent.) Tj T*
(Customer data must never be used for marketing or shared with marketing partners without a) Tj T*
(separate opt-in consent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(14. Vendors and outsourcing. Vendors must give the Bank and the Reserve Bank of India) Tj T*
(unrestricted access to premises, systems and records for audit and inspection. Vendors must not) Tj T*
(sub-contract any processing of customer data without the Bank's prior written approval. Vendors) Tj T*
(must report any security incident or data breach affecting customer data to the Bank within six) Tj T*
(hours of detection. All customer data, including backups, must be stored only on systems) Tj T*
(located in India.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(15. Training and review. All staff complete AML and KYC training every year. The Board reviews) Tj T*
(this policy at least once a year.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
